d drawings (RevisionMapping), and drawing a recognisable map, so walls, doors and windows are render layers of a revision, not domain entities. Allocation is a versioned event per cycle; Rules govern allocation, booking and check-in. References to Person, Group and Role are written in the cards (→). Each relation is coloured by the pillar it starts from. Grey dashed = spaceweave-owned, not offered by any surveyed vendor." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="54" width="3852" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg0" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#1d2030;strokeColor=#3b82f6;" value="" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="1546" width="16" height="14" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg0t" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#e6e8f0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" value="Places &amp; floor plans" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="56" y="1546" width="144" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#1d2030;strokeColor=#8b5cf6;" value="" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="212" y="1546" width="16" height="14" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg1t" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#e6e8f0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" value="Bookable" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="238" y="1546" width="60" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg2" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#1d2030;strokeColor=#2ee6c5;" value="" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="310" y="1546" width="16" height="14" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg2t" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#e6e8f0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" value="Space Allocation" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="336" y="1546" width="116" height="16" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg3" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#1d2030;strokeColor=#ec4899;" value="" ver